# The halium initramfs starts recovery's init at its second stage, which reads
# neither prop.halium nor init.recovery.${ro.hardware}.rc (ro.hardware is not
# set yet), so the settings for the system-image upgrader are set here.
#
# Ubuntu Touch is installed into system_a, grown to 4500 MB first. The stock
# system_ext_a and system_b, which Ubuntu Touch does not use, are removed to
# make room; vendor_a (the drivers) is kept.
on init
    setprop ro.systemimage.system_partition_size 4500
    setprop ro.systemimage.remove_dynparts_slot_a system_ext_a,system_b
